      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m not sure if I understand your question.\n\nSince we\u0027ve updated CellInfo in v1.2, any method (in v1.2) that has CellInfo in its signature needs to be redefined as well. That means we need to redefine IRadioIndication.cellInfoList and IRadioResponse.getCellInfoListResponse (getCellInfoListResponse has already been redefined in 1.2 which is why we didn\u0027t need to add it in this CL).\n\nThe 1.0 cellInfoList will continue to use the @1.0::CellInfo in its signature, so it doesn\u0027t need to change.",
